test.sh` prints `SELFTEST: PASS` at the fixed tip.","probe":"d=$(mktemp -d); mkdir -p \"$d/harness\" \"$d/home\"; cp scripts/project-node.sh scripts/lib.sh \"$d/\"; cp scripts/harness/install-hermes.sh \"$d/harness/\"; chmod +x \"$d/project-node.sh\"; HOME=\"$d/home\" \"$d/project-node.sh\" --apply --project cfprobe --harness hermes --repo https://github.com/github/gitignore; echo rc=$?","created_at":"2026-11-03T15:12:00Z","updated_at":"2026-11-03T16:20:18Z","commit_hash":"77caa02876732b83d87dc2ac7c509b0e535b25b3","guard_result":"PASS","ci_result":"SKIP","worker_summary":"Staged set is derived and validated: node-create.sh now stages project-node.sh, lib.sh, disk_floor.py and harness/install-<h>.sh, and fails closed when project-node.sh references an unstaged $HERE file. The disk-floor layer emits a counted FAIL row instead of a raw interpreter error, and a failed provision prints the explicit --server destroy command for the agent it spawned (never for a reused one). Proved by selftest section 16 (six rows) plus the row probe before/after. Live-host creation not exercised.","detail":{"evidence":[{"run_id":"ad52e74b","ts":"2026-11-03T16:20:18Z","tree_fp":"26476812aeab71241b95be8b132d9673e7cba134a088674bed492f9f6afb2d86","artifacts":["docs/audits/code-factory-foreman-2026-11-03-cf075.probe.txt"]}]}}
