lete_without_completion_event line prints empty. 2. CF-053's worker_status agrees with its status (complete) and its foreman_note names a re-runnable command or a committed artifact for the repoint, so the probe's complete_with_worker_status_pending line prints empty. 3. CF-005 is either closed with the command output that demonstrates each of its five acceptance criteria (cited in the completion event) or re-scoped with a dated reason; either way the probe's stale_inprogress line prints empty. 4. bash tests/selftest.sh prints SELFTEST: PASS and bash scripts/boardctl validate prints RESULT: OK.","probe":"R=$(pwd); cd \"$R\"; printf 'stale_inprogress=%s\\n' \"$(jq -r 'select(.status==\"in_progress\")|.id' .coding-hermes/board/tasks.jsonl | sort | tr '\\n' ' ')\"; printf 'complete_without_completion_event=%s\\n' \"$(comm -23 <(jq -r 'select(.status==\"complete\")|.id' .coding-hermes/board/tasks.jsonl | sort) <(jq -r 'select(.event_type==\"task_completed\")|.task_id' .coding-hermes/board/events.jsonl | sort -u) | tr '\\n' ' ')\"; printf 'complete_with_worker_status_pending=%s\\n' \"$(jq -r 'select(.status==\"complete\" and .worker_status==\"pending\")|.id' .coding-hermes/board/tasks.jsonl | tr '\\n' ' ')\"","detail":"sync-lane-code-factory-duckbrain-sync-2026-11-03-23-48-25-cf130","created_at":"2026-11-03T23:52:28Z","updated_at":"2026-11-03T23:52:28Z"}
